.TH smurf6 8 2026-02-07 THC IPv6 ATTACK TOOLKIT
.SH "نام (NAME)"
.B smurf6

.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
smurf6 [-i microseconds] interface victim-ip [multicast-network-address]

Smurf the target with icmp echo replies. Target of echo request is the
local all-nodes multicast address if not specified
